{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07274","headline":"题独孤使君湖上林亭 · 刘长卿","name":"题独孤使君湖上林亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"出树倚朱阑，吹铙引上官。\n老农持锸拜，时稼卷帘看。\n水对登龙净，山当建隼寒。\n夕阳湖草动，秋色渚田宽。\n渤海人无事，荆州客独安。\n谢公何足比，来往石门难。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07274.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07274","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}